## 1. Global Design System Foundations & Tokens

File: [`src/styles.css`](file:///c:/Users/skuma679/l0l3/E-commerce/frontend/src/styles.css)

### 1.1 Typography Families
* **Primary Sans-Serif**: `'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif`  
  * Weights loaded: `300 (Light)`, `400 (Regular)`, `500 (Medium)`, `600 (Semi-Bold)`, `700 (Bold)`, `800 (Extra-Bold)`
* **Code / Technical Monospace**: `'JetBrains Mono', monospace`  
  * Weights loaded: `400 (Regular)`, `500 (Medium)`, `600 (Semi-Bold)`  
  * Used for: Agent trace logs, carrier tracking codes, promo codes, spec keys.

### 1.2 Surface & Canvas Color Tokens
| CSS Token | Hex / RGBA Value | Role / Usage |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `--canvas-bg` | `#070a12` | Deep Obsidian base canvas background |
| `--surface-primary` | `#0f172a` | Deep Slate base for inner containers, table backgrounds, inputs |
| `--surface-secondary` | `#131c33` | Sub-surface for elevated sections |
| `--surface-elevated` | `#1e293b` | Slate-800 for cards, sidebars, headers, modal surfaces |
| `--surface-hover` | `#26334d` | Interactive hover state for elevated surfaces |
| `--surface-glass` | `rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75)` | Frosted glass backdrops with `backdrop-filter: blur(12px)` |

### 1.3 Canvas Ambient Gradient Lighting
```css
body {
  background-color: var(--canvas-bg);
  background-image: 
    radial-gradient(at 10% 10%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08) 0px, transparent 50%),
    radial-gradient(at 90% 90%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06) 0px, transparent 50%);
  background-attachment: fixed;
}
```

### 1.4 Typography Colors
* `--text-primary`: `#f8fafc` (High contrast pure white/slate-50 for headings and primary copy)
* `--text-secondary`: `#94a3b8` (Slate-400 for descriptions, secondary metadata, captions)
* `--text-tertiary`: `#64748b` (Slate-500 for subtle timestamps, helper labels)
* `--text-accent`: `#a5b4fc` (Indigo-200 for AI highlights, active labels, link accents)

### 1.5 Brand & AI Gradient Palette
* `--ai-primary`: `#6366f1` (Indigo-500 - Brand Hero Accent)
* `--ai-primary-hover`: `#4f46e5` (Indigo-600)
* `--ai-secondary`: `#8b5cf6` (Purple-500)
* `--ai-gradient`: `linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1 0%, #8b5cf6 50%, #a855f7 100%)`
* `--ai-gradient-glow`: `linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25) 100%)`
* `--ai-cyan`: `#06b6d4` (Cyan-500 - Telemetry & Diagnostic Agent)
* `--ai-amber`: `#f59e0b` (Amber-500 - Order Tracking & HITL Propose)
* `--ai-emerald`: `#10b981` (Emerald-500 - Grounding Critic & HITL Payment)
* `--ai-rose`: `#f43f5e` (Rose-500 - Deal Hunter & Cancellation)

### 1.6 Border & Divider System
* `--border-subtle`: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07)` (Card dividers, inactive borders)
* `--border-medium`: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)` (Component boundaries, inputs)
* `--border-bright`: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22)` (Hover borders)
* `--border-accent`: `rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.40)` (Active AI focus borders)

### 1.7 Elevation & Box Shadows
* `--shadow-subtle`: `0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)`
* `--shadow-card`: `0 12px 28px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`
* `--shadow-modal`: `0 24px 60px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)`
* `--shadow-glow`: `0 0 35px -5px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.35)`
* `--shadow-hitl`: `0 0 30px -5px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35)`

### 1.8 Corner Radii
* `--radius-sm`: `6px` (Badges, small buttons, tags)
* `--radius-md`: `10px` (Inputs, sub-cards, pills)
* `--radius-lg`: `16px` (Product cards, copilot panel, modal cards)
* `--radius-xl`: `22px` (Hero containers, large surfaces)
* `--radius-pill`: `9999px` (Pill buttons, category chips, status badges)

